(`clear @s #ntm:rad/bit_8 0`, `execute if block ... #ns:tag`).
Base: upstream 9e49037875b91efe07a2d5e4714a113d052df17a (main de 2026-10-29). Só crates/horizon-client/src/mod_content.rs.
